====Usage notes====
In modern Bulgarian, the singular of {{l|bg|нога́}} is mostly obsolete. Only the dual {{l|bg|нозе́}} is being used, specifically in the sense [[feet]] {{gloss|the immovable part of the lower limb}}. The sense [[leg]] is nowadays conveyed by {{l|bg|крак}} (originally: [[spanning]], [[striding]] [[limb]]).

